    "leaf_findings": "Selected leafs resolve to libc memcpy/recv/send for Hyle and memcpy/read/write for peer, motivating syscall seam alignment. Source counters already showed equal body-copy bytes and no compaction; different memcpy sample percentages alone do not imply extra copied bytes."
